WAS ABSENT FROM THE CAMPAIGN

00:00:50.316 --> 00:00:52.685
TRAIL.
THE ADS DON'T SEEM TO BE AS

00:00:52.685 --> 00:00:54.320
NUMEROUS.
AND THERE DOES NOT FEEL THERE'S

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:57.523
A TON OF ENERGY.
THIS CAME DOWN TO THE SUBURBS.

00:00:57.523 --> 00:01:00.760
CAN HE CONVENTION THE 200,000
PEOPLE THAT VOTED FOR BRIAN KEMP

00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:04.297
BUT VOTED FOR RAPHAEL WARNOCK TO
SHOW UP AND CLICK ON HIS NAME.

00:01:04.297 --> 00:01:07.433
AND IT DOESN'T FEEL LIKE THAT'S
HAPPENING.

00:01:07.433 --> 00:01:10.470
&gt;&gt; SO, YOU TOLD CNN IN THE FALL
THAT WALKER DIDN'T DO ENOUGH TO

00:01:10.470 --> 00:01:12.839
