NOVEMBER.

00:01:12.839 --> 00:01:14.674
WILL YOU BE VOTING FOR HIM NEXT
TUESDAY?

00:01:14.674 --> 00:01:16.409
&gt;&gt; Reporter: SHOWED UP TO VOTE
THIS MORNING.

00:01:16.409 --> 00:01:19.712
I WAS ONE OF THOSE FOLKS WHO GOT
IN LINE AND SPENT ABOUT AN HOUR

00:01:19.712 --> 00:01:21.848
WAITING.
IT WAS THE MOST DISAPPOINTING

00:01:21.848 --> 00:01:25.818
BALLOT I'VE EVER STARED AT IN MY
ENTIRE LIFE SINCE I STARTED

00:01:25.818 --> 00:01:28.121
VOTING.
