00:01:28.121 --> 00:01:31.257
COULDN'T FIND ANYTHING THAT MADE
SENSE FOR ME TO PUT MY VOTE

00:01:31.257 --> 00:01:33.459
BEHIND.
SO, I WALKED OUT OF THAT BALLOT

00:01:33.459 --> 00:01:37.530
BOX SHOWING UP TO VOTE, BUT NOT
VOTING FOR EITHER ONE OF THEM.

00:01:37.530 --> 00:01:41.568
&gt;&gt; SO, YOU DIDN'T VOTE.
DIANNE GALLAGHER REPORTING WE'RE

00:01:41.568 --> 00:01:44.504
SEEING RECORD BREAKING EARLY
VOTE NUMBERS IN GEORGIA.

00:01:44.504 --> 00:01:48.774
SO, DO YOU THINK THAT'S GOOD
NEWS FOR THE DEMOCRATIC CAMPAIGN

00:01:48.774 --> 00:01:52.345
HERE OR BECAUSE WE'RE TALKING
ABOUT A RUNOFF HERE AND A REALLY

00:01:52.345 --> 00:01:54.881
COMPRESSED SCHEDULE, DOES THAT
CONVENTIONAL WISDOM GET THROWN

00:01:54.881 --> 00:01:58.618
OUT OF THE WINDOW?
&gt;&gt; NO, UNDOUBTEDLY THAT'S GOOD

00:01:58.618 --> 00:02:00.887
NEWS FOR DEMOCRATS.
WE'VE SEEN THE TRENDS.

00:02:00.887 --> 00:02:06.125
INSTEAD OF HAVING THESE POLLING
DATA WHERE REPUBLICANS FLOOD THE

00:02:06.125 --> 00:02:10.830
ZONE WITH JUST POOR POLLS, WHAT
WE SEE NOW IS THAT WE ACTUALLY

00:02:10.830 --> 00:02:14.467
HAVE DATA WE CAN LOOK AT.
THAT'S THE EARLY VOTING NUMBERS,

00:02:14.467 --> 00:02:17.870
WHERE THEY COME FROM IN GEORGIA.
LIEUTENANT GOVERNOR DUNCAN IS

00:02:17.870 --> 00:02:21.741
PROBABLY BETTER THAN I AT
TELLING YOU WHAT IT MEANS WHEN

00:02:21.741 --> 00:02:26.713
