BUT I DO BELIEVE THAT WHAT WE'RE

00:02:28.982 --> 00:02:31.084
SEEING IS THAT DEMOCRATS ARE
COMING OUT.

00:02:31.084 --> 00:02:33.820
I THINK RAPHAEL WARNOCK IS
RUNNING THE PITCH PERFECT

00:02:33.820 --> 00:02:36.956
CAMPAIGN FOR THE MOMENT.
AND LET ME ALSO SAY THIS, THIS

00:02:36.956 --> 00:02:42.528
IS SOMEWHAT CONTENTIOUS FOR
PEOPLE WHO MAY NOT BE FAMILIAR

00:02:42.528 --> 00:02:44.030
CULTURALLY WITH WHAT I'M ABOUT
TO SAY.

00:02:44.030 --> 00:02:48.801
BUT THERE IS A GREAT DEAL OF
RESENTMENT BY BLACK VOTERS FOR

00:02:48.801 --> 00:02:50.937
HERSCHEL WALKER.
THERE ARE MANY BLACK VOTERS WHO

00:02:50.937 --> 00:02:54.774
YOU SPEAK TO WHO SIMPLY SAY THAT
HE DOES NOT SPEAK OR REPRESENT

00:02:54.774 --> 00:03:01.381
US VERY WELL AT ALL, FROM THE
ALLEGATIONS OF ABUSE, FROM BEING

00:03:01.381 --> 00:03:04.250
INARTICULATE, FOR NOT
UNDERSTANDING BASIC CONCEPTS.

00:03:04.250 --> 00:03:07.954
AND THEREFORE, WE DO NOT WANT
HIM TO REPRESENT US ON THE WORLD

00:03:07.954 --> 00:03:11.491
STAGE AS A UNITED STATES SENATOR
IN WASHINGTON, D.C.

00:03:11.491 --> 00:03:15.461
I EXPECT YOU'RE GOING TO HAVE A
LARGE NUMBER OF BLACK VOTERS

00:03:15.461 --> 00:03:20.333
COME OUT, AGAIN, FOR RAPHAEL
WARNOCK, OVERCOMING THE FATIGUE,

00:03:20.333 --> 00:03:25.405
AND A GREAT DEAL OF YOUNG VOTERS
COME OUT FOR RAPHAEL WARNOCK,

00:03:25.405 --> 00:03:28.308
