00:03:43.623 --> 00:03:47.026
&gt;&gt; I THINK I'M IN THE SAME SPOT
THAT HUNDREDS OF THOUSANDS OF

00:03:47.026 --> 00:03:50.997
REPUBLICANS AND MILLIONS ACROSS
